---
// Footer editorial Ferramenta Clara
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-container">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <div class="footer-logo">
        <svg class="footer-mark" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect x="4" y="4" width="32" height="32" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" rx="2"/>
          <path d="M12 12 L12 22 L18 22 M12 17 L17 17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter"/>
          <path d="M22 12 L22 22 M22 12 L28 12 M22 17 L27 17 M22 22 L28 22" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter"/>
          <circle cx="20" cy="28" r="1.5" fill="currentColor"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="footer-logo-text">Ferramenta Clara</span>
      </div>
      <p class="footer-tagline">Dados claros para escolher melhor.</p>
      <p class="footer-method">Comparações e guias de ferramentas baseados em especificações verificáveis e fontes abertas.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-nav">
      <a href="/">Comparações</a>
      <a href="/#metodologia">Metodologia</a>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p class="footer-disclaimer">Conteúdo independente. Algumas páginas poderão futuramente conter links de afiliados.</p>
      <p class="footer-credits">Fotografias via <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a> sob licenças Creative Commons. Veja créditos completos em cada artigo.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--steel);
    margin-top: 5rem;
    padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem 2.5rem;
  }

  .footer-container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--steel);
  }

  .footer-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.625rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .footer-mark {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    color: var(--amber);
  }

  .footer-logo-text {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--paper);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .footer-tagline {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--paper);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .footer-method {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--steel);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 65ch;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .footer-nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--steel);
  }

  .footer-nav a {
    color: var(--paper);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .footer-nav a:hover {
    color: var(--amber);
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .footer-disclaimer,
  .footer-credits {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--steel);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .footer-credits a {
    color: var(--steel);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--amber);
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .footer-credits a:hover {
    color: var(--amber);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .site-footer {
      padding: 2.5rem 1rem 2rem;
    }

    .footer-nav {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
